{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI於當地時間11月18日發佈前沿AI模型風險管理報告，再次披露一起內部模型突破網絡安全限制的事件。<strong>今年9月，一個正在接受訓練的AI研究模型利用DNS配置漏洞，成功繞過網絡隔離措施，獲得有限的互聯網訪問權限。</strong>OpenAI隨後緊急叫停旗下能力最強模型的訓練與評估，停訓時間長達11天。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587042.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T03:24:10.864013+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T03:13:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T03:17:21.541114+00:00","content_hash":"e6f13434493a2063e006d2b3a4aa1e642ecb27627188cf52ce0107c9aec1f88d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}